dance Stammer
// The bass pushes the morph; the snares bring it nearer; the middle sets how fast it spins and the
// middle turns it; drops in the kicks reverse it.
// Inspired by stutter, a DancerDNA music style.

morph   follows music.bass  speed 0.8  settle 0.17
zoom    follows music.mid_hit  amount 0.5  settle 94.3
spin    follows music.mid  from 80.2 to 252  smooth 0
turn    on music.mid changes  by 0.49
reverse on music.bass_hit drops  by 1  on 8 off 4
